# Final Project Demo Script

## 1. Introduction
Hello, my name is Jaspreet Kaur. This is my final project demo for my Movie API back-end application.

## 2. Application Demo
This project is a RESTful Movie API built with Node.js, Express, Firebase, Joi validation, Swagger documentation, and Jest testing.

I will demonstrate the main CRUD operations:
- Create a movie
- Get all movies
- Get one movie
- Update a movie
- Delete a movie

I also added advanced features such as filtering, sorting, pagination, and validation.

## 3. New Component
For the new component, I added secure authentication and role-based authorization using Firebase. This protects routes and allows only authorized users to access certain actions.

## 4. Test Execution
Now I will run the test suite using:

npm test

The tests check important parts of the application, including movie service functions and authentication middleware.

