## 6. Technical Challenges and Learning
One challenge I faced was mixing TypeScript and JavaScript files. I solved it by keeping the project consistent in JavaScript and using CommonJS imports.

I also learned how to organize middleware, validation, tests, Swagger documentation, and security features in a cleaner way.

## 7. Conclusion
This project demonstrates a working back-end API with CRUD operations, security, documentation, testing, and final project organization.